  :consistency "ADR-2607310900 estimated ~90-250ms per round trip. 173-190ms sits
                inside that, and four independent hosts (3974/4175/4326/4437) agree
                to within 12%."
  :does-not-check-out
  "The 2026-08-08 handler cost of 2,422ms implies ~13 round trips at the same
   per-hop cost, which is FEWER than the 18 pre-segmentation singles that should
   already have existed. One of these is wrong: the 18 count, the assumption that
   no fold ran between 08-02 and 08-08, or the assumption that per-hop cost is
   vantage-independent. Latency alone cannot discriminate. Recorded as an open
   inconsistency rather than resolved by picking the convenient branch."}

